  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components, adjust pH to 8.0 with NaOH, then distribute the medium into culture vessels (e.g., 20--50 ml per 120 ml serum bottles), seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave at 110C for 5 min. Allow to stand the autoclaved medium overnight. Add ethane to the gas phase (10 to 50% of the gas phase by volume)."
    }
  ]
